    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "BWANA kubonya nguma ndoenyi kwa sere",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kula mbari yadatasa na kusikira mlungu ghwawo, ela isi dichamtasa BWANA Mlungu odu kwa kala na kala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Waisraeli kuwuya kufuma wubarishonyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA waghamba, “Ngelo ichacha, nani nichawitumbanya chiaimweri wandu nerewikabieghe; awo wandu wijie wasi aho wubarishonyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakelemeshero na kuwikwa kula na mzawo, ela nichabonya masighariko ghawo wizoe kwa wuwishi, ela wichawuya mbari mbaa. Kufuma ngelo iyo, nichawibonyera nguma aighu ya Mghondi ghwa Sioni kwa kala na kala.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na oho, ee Jerusalemu, andu Mlungu orekoghe ukichereshera wandu wake sa mlisha uko mnarenyi, nichakubonya kukaie muzi m'baa ghwa wuzuri ghonyu sa kala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idana kuliliaki nandighi huwu? Kwaki kujagha wasi sa muka ukumbagha lufu lova? Ni angu kusewadie mzuri? Mnjama wako oofwa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kung'arishenyi msirimike inyo wandu wa Jerusalemu sa muka uvagha; kwa kukaia idana kuchasigha muzi kughende isanga ja kula. Kuchaghenda Babuloni, ela BWANA uchakukira ahoeni kufuma kwa wamaiza wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbari ra wandu wengi rakwanyika kulwa na oho. Waghamba, “Ni suti Jerusalemu itotesho! Dichawona muzi ughu ghukinonwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela mbari iri nderimanyagha maghesho gha BWANA. Ndewiwuetambukilwa wei weetumbanywa chiaimweri wipate kukabwa, seji viro viredwagha vipate kusheghwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA waghamba, “Wandu wa Jerusalemu, ghendenyi muwikabe wamaiza wenyu. Nicham'bonya mkaie na ndighi sa njau iko na mbembe ra chuma, na kochokocho ra shaba. Mcharifasha-fasha mbari ra wandu wengi; na iro mali wiripatire kwa kusoka, mchanifunyira ini BWANA wa wurumwengu ghose.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
